      <h1 id="virt-creating-vms-from-instance-types" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating virtual machines from instance types<a href="#virt-creating-vms-from-instance-types" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
